{
    "background_story": "Miles was a blobfish who lived in the depths of the ocean. He was often ridiculed by the other sea creatures for his, well, less-than-stunning appearance. Miles had a gelatinous body, a perpetually sad face, and a tendency to hover listlessly in the water. Despite his fugly exterior, Miles had a beautiful singing voice. Every night, he would belt out a haunting melody that echoed through the ocean, entrancing all who heard it. As word of his talent spread, Miles became a local celebrity, with fish from far and wide coming to hear him sing. His uniqueness and hidden talent made him a beloved fixture in the ocean community, proving that even the fugliest of creatures can have a beauty that shines from within.",
